  "message": "You can melt the bar soap in a pot of water over low heat, stirring until it’s fully softened. Thin the melted soap with more warm water (about 1 part soap to 3–5 parts water) until it reaches a liquid consistency you like, then let it cool. Add a few drops of essential oil or a pinch of salt for fragrance or texture if you want, and pour it into a clean bottle for use.",
